     <P>1、考场编排</P>
<P><A title=学生准考证 href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201903/2019031108463476.xls">学生准考证</A></P>
<P>请各班在今天放学前将教室布置成37位考场（77887），<STRONG>书本全部放到柜子里，<SPAN style="COLOR: red">课桌上、课桌内、椅子下不可放书本</SPAN><FONT size=3>；教室卫生整洁，擦干净黑板。</FONT></STRONG></P>
<P>班主任请提醒学生<SPAN lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 10.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10.3pt; mso-char-indent-count: -.98"><FONT size=3><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN></FONT><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>）进入考场<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal">只能携带相关文具</B></FONT><FONT size=3>，书包、书本全部放在考场外。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 10.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10.3pt; mso-char-indent-count: -.98"><FONT size=3><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN></FONT><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>）<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal">遵守考试纪律</B></FONT><FONT size=3>，开考铃响前和结束铃响后禁止答题，否则将作为违规处理，</FONT><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><FONT size=3>取消该科目考试成绩并由德育处按相关规定处理</FONT></B><FONT size=3>。考试过程中原则上禁止上厕所，如有特殊情况，需向监考老师报告。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 10.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10.3pt; mso-char-indent-count: -.98"><FONT size=3><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN></FONT><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>）本次考试贴条形码，学生拿到答题之后请<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal">认真核对条形码和自己是否一致</B></FONT></SPAN><FONT size=3><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>。</SPAN></B><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 10.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10.3pt; mso-char-indent-count: -.98"><FONT size=3><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>4</SPAN></FONT><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>）<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal">客观题</B></FONT><FONT size=3>答题请用</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>2B</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>铅笔填涂，<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal">填涂要规范，因个人填涂不规范造成的问题，不予修改</B></FONT><FONT size=3>；</FONT><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><FONT size=3>主观题</FONT></B><FONT size=3>答题用黑色签字笔，不要超出答题区域框，答错区域要报告监考老师。</FONT><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><FONT size=3>不能</FONT></B><FONT size=3>使用涂改液、透明胶。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 10.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10.3pt; mso-char-indent-count: -.98"><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3></FONT></SPAN> </P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 10.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10.3pt; mso-char-indent-count: -.98"><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>2、监考安排</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 10.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10.3pt; mso-char-indent-count: -.98"><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>请监考老师提前20分钟到图书馆考务室领卷贴条形码，领卷后直入试场，提前5分钟发卷。收卷时<STRONG>缺考学生试卷也要收回</STRONG>，清点无误后交回考务组。</FONT></SPAN></P>
